        "@id": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-4381-1",
        "name": "USN-4381-1",
        "description": "Dan Palmer discovered that Django incorrectly validated memcached cache keys. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service and obtain sensitive information. (CVE-2020-13254)  Jon Dufresne discovered that Django incorrectly encoded query parameters for the admin ForeignKeyRawIdWidget. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to perform XSS attacks. (CVE-2020-13596)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2020-13254",
          "CVE-2020-13596"
        ]
      },
